{"shortDescription":"Australian stocks edged lower on Wednesday, as gains in financials were eclipsed by a more than 2% drop in heavyweight mining stocks as base metal prices remained weak.The S\u0026P/ASX 200 ASX:XJO lost 0.1% to hit 9,118.60 by 2338 GMT. The index had gained roughly 1.2% over the last two sessions.The res…","astDescription":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"p","children":["Australian stocks edged lower on Wednesday, as gains in financials were eclipsed by a more than 2% drop in heavyweight mining stocks as base metal prices remained weak."]},{"type":"p","children":["The S\u0026P/ASX 200 ",{"type":"symbol","params":{"symbol":"ASX:XJO","text":"ASX:XJO"}}," lost 0.1% to hit 9,118.60 by 2338 GMT. The index had gained roughly 1.2% over the last two sessions."]},{"type":"p","children":["The resources sub-index ",{"type":"symbol","params":{"symbol":"ASX:XMM","text":"ASX:XMM"}}," was the biggest drag on the benchmark, after advancing around 4.6% over the past two days. The sector came under pressure due to range-bound iron ore and lower copper prices."]},{"type":"p","children":["BHP ",{"type":"symbol","params":{"symbol":"ASX:BHP","text":"ASX:BHP"}}," and Rio Tinto ",{"type":"symbol","params":{"symbol":"ASX:RIO","text":"ASX:RIO"}},", two of the sub-index's biggest names, dropped 1.3% and 2.1%, respectively."]},{"type":"p","children":["Among gold miners ",{"type":"symbol","params":{"symbol":"ASX:XGD","text":"ASX:XGD"}},", which tracked a near 3% slide in bullion prices, Northern Star Resources ",{"type":"symbol","params":{"symbol":"ASX:NST","text":"ASX:NST"}}," and Evolution Mining ",{"type":"symbol","params":{"symbol":"ASX:EVN","text":"ASX:EVN"}}," declined 3% and 2.5%, respectively."]},{"type":"p","children":["Healthcare stocks ",{"type":"symbol","params":{"symbol":"ASX:XHJ","text":"ASX:XHJ"}}," dropped 0.2%. Index constituents Cochlear ",{"type":"symbol","params":{"symbol":"ASX:COH","text":"ASX:COH"}}," and Pro Medicus ",{"type":"symbol","params":{"sym